ch in <strong>protein, healthy fats, magnesium, zinc and antioxidants</strong>, pumpkin seeds can be enjoyed on their own or added to your favourite meals.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Choose TreeBites Pumpkin Seeds?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rich in plant-based protein</li>\n<li>Source of healthy fats</li>\n<li>Contains magnesium and zinc</li>\n<li>Naturally rich in antioxidants</li>\n<li>Great for everyday snacking</li>\n<li>Easy to add to salads, smoothies, oatmeal and yogurt</li>\n<li>Premium quality and carefully packed for freshness</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How to Enjoy:</strong><br>Enjoy them as a wholesome snack or sprinkle them over salads, cereals, oatmeal, yogurt and other favourite dishes for an extra crunch and nutritional boost.</p>\n<p><strong>TreeBites — Nourishing Roots, Enriching Lives.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-auto grid\">\n<div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"sticky bottom-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"min-h-9 pt-2 text-center text-xs text-token-text-tertiary [view-transition-name:var(--vt-disclaimer)] pb-4 relative overflow-hidden @w-sm/main:px-[60px]\">\n<div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
